{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5726e740955796be80c7e13a9350694da4813485edf7c1e3f95c1cf666fd63ba",
      "text": "升学补习班广告旁白的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b4241f882ee82c0d29187d37817a1331a3d877da0994a4e694963abbcca2fe2",
      "text": "“不要放弃，向前迈进吧。\n没关系，你不是一个人”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82331c8cea56011ee6d44738d2329d7d97593ee24bd7538a9f1e33431ea88277",
      "text": "“在这里，有能够助你一臂之力的人”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a8f591630855412e3a2a16b08dfa5b00214c76603de6b5e5e07d67502c34d2e",
      "text": "“为了成为理想中的自己，现在就行动起来吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000032:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef85eaf7976a0d242392c972051e707c7d3921a739d055ebb7dc2486457f6b24",
      "text": "锐心先生，辛苦了！\n旁白非常清晰易懂呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d65cc26bf44ee1ce3b97096cea59f53379e38e18ff0d5ca2ec7a2f6552724ec",
      "text": "最重要的是，能让人感受到在背后推人一把的力量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f27c30fefedc6ac205b2bce9cd403c82c1e12bc15a7cb2cd5f715d0696cf95f",
      "text": "这是理所当然的。为了只凭语言就能传达给对方，\n我在配旁白时一直注重这一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a25b9fa6b55db033915b91d3ce169a18c255c9a0fdbe4adcd3ea2053e3021cce",
      "text": "不过……这次的工作，倒成了一个思考“声音演技”\n深奥之处的好机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9714f95e41c369416e5ffadd9e0658a6ff7e02b219730d54dfdea97458b0e25",
      "text": "听到锐心先生的旁白，\n想必会有很多考生被打动，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77a66eacd6fc737a32d8d3aba0d6a88976dbde05443f9c7d1b9bc177263c20e7",
      "text": "锐心先生自己的未来，\n或许也照进了一束全新的光芒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_01:1_5_049_01:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d2d9c80d08ca4dbcd268c067901804afee16266fd7948186f2120c0cb4f321",
      "text": "呵，是啊。对我来说，\n似乎也成了一个向前迈出一步的契机。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
